**Parsing input attributes**

I want to parse the `rendered.html` file to find input IDs and relevant attributes. So, I'll use Python for this. My approach will be to utilize regex to capture things like `id="FileId"...maxlength="50"`. It seems straightforward, but I need to ensure I'm targeting the right patterns to get accurate results. Let’s see how that works out!
